            skos:note "EMA SPOR Product Management System (PMS) is the EMA system for pharmaceutical / medicinal products; https://spor.ema.europa.eu/pmswi/. PMS requires registration; a PMS medicinal product instance should be contributed by PGO members with EMA SPOR access. Regulatory" ;
