            skos:note "UO — Units Ontology; OBO Foundry ontology for scientific units of measurement. Research & Early Development; Manufacturing & Technical Operations; Clinical Development" ;
            skos:scopeNote "Covers SI, metric and derived units for quantitative scientific data" ;
