ns1:PGO-00000019 a skos:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "excipient"@en ;
    dcterms:description "**Round 1** (2026-01-15) The session (2026-01-15) covered Excipient as the first concept (API was the second concept, no consensus reached — see another concept). Multiple candidates were reviewed. The discussion quickly narrowed to two finalists: ChEBI CHEBI_75324 and DRON:00000029. The ChEBI definition (\"A generally pharmacologically inactive substance that is formulated with the active ingredient of a medication\") was acknowledged as a \"negative\" definition — it defines excipient by what it is not (not the active ingredient). Despite this limitation, the group converged on it for three reasons: (1) an expert/Roche confirmed ChEBI is the definition adopted by ISO IDMP, giving PGO-IDMP interoperability out of the box; (2) Birgit/Pfizer confirmed the same (\"authoritative source & adopted by IDMP-O\"); (3) it is concise and from a well-maintained, resolvable source. The DRON definition was positively framed (listing what excipients do: aid manufacture, prolong shelf life, ensure proper administration), which Darko/Novo Nordisk acknowledged is semantically better. However, the phrase \"scattered molecular aggregate\" was universally criticised as impractical. The IDMP-O and EMA definitions were noted as essentially equivalent to ChEBI or weaker, and did not advance. The EMA definition (\"a constituent of a medicine other than the active substance\") was considered by some as simpler but without strong reason to prefer it over ChEBI. **Outcome:** Consensus reached on ChEBI CHEBI_75324 as the preferred definition with the label `Excipient`. Formal recommendation submitted to Steering Group."@en ;
    dcterms:identifier "PGO-00000019" ;
    dcterms:license <https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/> ;
    dcterms:rights "ChEBI: Chemical Entities of Biological Interest, EMBL-EBI. CHEBI_75324. http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_75324"@en ;
    dcterms:source <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_75324> ;
    skos:altLabel "Formulation ingredient"@en,
        "Inactive ingredient"@en,
        "Pharmaceutical excipient"@en ;
    skos:broader ns1:PGO-00000000 ;
    skos:definition "A generally pharmacologically inactive substance that is formulated with the active ingredient of a medication."@en ;
    skos:editorialNote "Synonym 'Formulation ingredient': non-active"@en,
        "excipient role: Excipient is a role of a generally pharmacologically inactive substance that is formulated with the active ingredient of a medication. [ChEBI] [http://purl.allotrope.org/ontologies/role#AFRL_0000226]"@en,
        "excipient: A constituent of a medicine other than the active substance. [https://www.ema.europa.eu/en/glossary-terms/excipient]"@en,
        "excipient: Excipient is defined as a component of a pharmaceutical formulation that serves specific functions, such as aiding in the delivery or stability of the active ingredient. [https://www.sciencedirect.com/topics/pharmacology-toxicology-and-pharmaceutical-science/excipient]"@en,
        "excipient: Pharmacological role of a generally pharmacologically inactive substance that is formulated with the active ingredient of a medication. [https://spec.pistoiaalliance.org/idmp/ontology/ISO/ISO11238-Substances/Excipient]"@en,
        "excipient: [Pharmacological role of] a generally pharmacologically inactive substance that is formulated with the active ingredient of a medication. [(URL not provided)]"@en ;
    skos:exactMatch <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_75324> ;
    skos:example [ dcterms:description "Filler/diluent excipient in solid oral dosage forms"@en ;
            dcterms:identifier <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_759844> ;
            rdf:value "Lactose monohydrate" ;
            prov:wasDerivedFrom "ChEBI" ],
        [ dcterms:description "Binder and disintegrant excipient in tablets"@en ;
            dcterms:identifier <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_757032> ;
            rdf:value "Microcrystalline cellulose" ;
            prov:wasDerivedFrom "ChEBI" ],
        [ dcterms:description "Bulking agent excipient in lyophilised formulations"@en ;
            dcterms:identifier <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_16899> ;
            rdf:value "Mannitol" ;
            prov:wasDerivedFrom "ChEBI" ] ;
    skos:inScheme ns1:PGOConceptScheme ;
    skos:prefLabel "excipient"@en ;
    prov:endedAtTime "2026-03-03"^^xsd:date ;
    prov:generatedAtTime "2026-11-24"^^xsd:date ;
